  "subtitle": "Dr Brynjar Obiora, Senior Research Fellow",
  "summary": "A short profile of Dr Brynjar Obiora, Senior Research Fellow in the School of Underlying Conditions, told largely in his own words. A soil surveyor of twelve years' standing, Dr Obiora describes the question at the centre of his research: where one soil ends and the next begins when the ground changes by degrees, and who decides. The film also marks his seed grant to renew the survey's soil colour book, one page at a time, and a body of work that reaches well beyond the pit.",
